category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libQt5Core-devel libQt5Gui-devel
sdesc: "SMTP library written in C++ for Qt (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The SimpleMail is small library writen for Qt 5 (C++11) that allows
applications to send complex emails (plain text, html, attachments, inline
files, etc.) using the Simple Mail Transfer Protocol (SMTP)."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/cutelyst/simple-mail
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later
